    <briefdescription>
<para>Overloaded operators for string comparison. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Operators are provided specifically for comparing string types, such as <computeroutput>std::string_view</computeroutput>. These operators enable clear, expressive assertions when verifying string values in test cases, supporting both equality and inequality checks.</para>
<para>Using these dedicated operators ensures concise, readable tests that accurately reflect intended logic. The framework ensures correct string comparisons and reports failed checks with both actual and expected values for clear diagnostics.</para>
